    13	 * (Bluesky/GitHub/keyhive-user), which remains the alpha stub. The node sharePolicy
    14	 * gates inbound network peers through the sealed face gate (`face-gate`); the browser admits
    15	 * only same-origin/in-process peers (a legitimate asymmetry, not an open hole). See
    16	 * lararium-canonical-model #open-drift (point 4).
